Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.94,0:00:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ace, Luffy! Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.24,0:00:21.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The three of us, we're\Ngonna leave this country!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.46,0:00:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna sail the seas\Nand see the whole world!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.32,0:00:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From now on, we're\Nhonest-to-goodness brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.62,0:00:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cheers to that!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.80,0:00:32.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brothers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.90,0:00:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long are you going to\Nlay there like a moron?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.70,0:01:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, the treasure we were\Nkeeping in the forest is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.94,0:01:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone must have gotten to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.52,0:01:04.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meh, I don't care about the treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.06,0:01:05.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.12,0:01:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, those were pirate\Nsavings I was sharing with Sabo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.54,0:01:11.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you, too, later on, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.74,0:01:14.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in the end, he didn't\Nneed money to set sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.80,0:01:17.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why should I get bent\Nout of shape about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.06,0:01:22.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, what's the point in having\Ntreasure if you can't even protect it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.70,0:01:24.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.08,0:01:26.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.28,0:01:30.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanna get stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.56,0:01:50.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be the strongest in the world and then
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.82,0:01:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll protect everyone I will lose Anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.70,0:01:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I care about you gotta make me a promise
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.00,0:02:03.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you, please don't die, Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.06,0:02:04.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cut it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.76,0:02:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You ought to be worried\Nabout dying before I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.82,0:02:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What, did you forget you're\Na lot weaker than me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.52,0:02:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, and you listen up good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.82,0:02:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm never going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.64,0:02:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, Sabo told me\Nto take care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.94,0:02:28.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I promise, I'm not\Ngonna die, okay? Not ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.06,0:02:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least not as long as I've got a wussy\Nlittle brother who needs me to protect him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.02,0:02:34.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.72,0:02:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smarts aren't exactly my strong point,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.88,0:02:41.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I still don't really\Nunderstand why Sabo was killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.28,0:02:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But whoever did it,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.90,0:02:46.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they must be opposed\Nto freedom because they
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.70,0:02:49.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,shot him down before he\Never got a taste of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.62,0:02:54.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we shared that same cup of sake\Nwith him, and we're still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.14,0:03:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, listen to me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.14,0:03:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's just one way to live\Nand that's without any regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.04,0:03:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boys from families like\Nmine once they turn
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.46,0:03:26.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,18 they're officially\Nregistered as nobles.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.32,0:03:28.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.46,0:03:30.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta be gone before I'm 17.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.22,0:03:35.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.86,0:03:38.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna set sail just like Sabo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.78,0:03:40.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna live the way we wanna live.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.84,0:03:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More free than anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.98,0:03:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you know what that means?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.54,0:03:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll make plenty of\Nenemies along the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.08,0:03:52.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna have to\Nfight Garp someday I bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.78,0:03:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta be willing to risk everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.40,0:03:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go out to sea at 17,\Njust like Sabo planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.48,0:04:01.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, we'll be pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.56,0:04:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you.
