Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.02,0:07:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world noble's visit to the\NGoa Kingdom has come and gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.56,0:07:06.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But another visitor lingers at a\Nsmall village in the East Blue.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:04.95,0:07:11.69,Title,,0,0,240,,{\fad(1000,1250)}Will of the Winds
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.78,0:07:11.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A group of aspiring swordsmen\Nchat about the strange encounter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.58,0:07:26.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you see that weird guy\Nwith the big head? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.22,0:07:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Face was totally crazy too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.04,0:07:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I I bet he needs that giant\Nship to fit his giant head.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.56,0:07:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,580, 581,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.74,0:07:41.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,582, 583, 584.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.12,0:07:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You certainly kept me waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.44,0:07:51.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What could possibly be\Nmore important than me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.58,0:07:54.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.72,0:07:56.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.66,0:07:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.62,0:07:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone get help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.00,0:08:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This doesn't look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.40,0:08:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's prepare treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.74,0:08:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.40,0:08:08.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, what in the world\Nhave you been up to all day?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.10,0:08:12.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was watching the ceremony\Nthey held for the World Noble.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.14,0:08:13.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.62,0:08:18.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, that's some risky business,\Nand two, why didn't you take me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.34,0:08:22.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because you would attract too\Nmuch attention, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.40,0:08:25.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it be I'm too fabulous?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.98,0:08:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At any rate, we've\Ntarried for long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.00,0:08:31.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got business to attend to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.12,0:08:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do we have supplies?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.10,0:08:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The training hall at the village\Ngave us just enough food for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.58,0:08:39.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.36,0:08:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Set sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.10,0:08:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're heading back to Baltico.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.48,0:08:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A short time later, in\Nthe nearby Goa Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.84,0:09:01.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.94,0:09:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally, some junk!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.54,0:09:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although the fire raised Grey\NTerminal and its people to the ground,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.66,0:09:13.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,another sea of trash and another\Nsea of scavengers appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.72,0:09:20.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're in for it this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.82,0:09:21.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here it goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.28,0:09:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.50,0:09:26.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.90,0:09:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.40,0:09:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still suck butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.48,0:09:49.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter how hard you\Npunch if you can't hit anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.90,0:09:52.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you, rubber's a crappy power.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.26,0:09:53.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no good for fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.22,0:09:55.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up! You're dumb!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.22,0:09:57.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the dumb one!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.28,0:09:58.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm honest, that's all!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.94,0:10:02.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to save you from falling\Non your stupid rubber ass all day!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.92,0:10:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just jealous because you\Ncan't do all the stuff like me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.06,0:10:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you've got are jerk powers and I'm\Nworking on all kinds of cool moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.38,0:10:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, that was great!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.28,0:10:17.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, that punch of yours flies further\Nand further every day! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.60,0:10:19.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you go easy on him,\Nhe'll get a big head!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.98,0:10:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got stronger today and I'm\Ngonna be even stronger tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.46,0:10:24.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Sabo?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.28,0:10:44.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This Sabo was a nice\Nbrother, not like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.96,0:10:48.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're trying to say it'd be\Nbetter if I died, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.90,0:10:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.44,0:11:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm hereby establishing my own country.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.20,0:11:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's doing what now?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:18.86,0:11:19.72,Country Sign,,0,0,0,,{\pos(760,547)}Ace's Country
Dialogue: 1,0:11:19.72,0:11:20.56,Country Sign,,0,0,0,,{\pos(918.334,256.999)}Luffy's Country
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.66,0:11:26.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you little idiots up to now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.92,0:11:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to be strong\Nenough to live on our own!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.86,0:11:31.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're from the Dadan kingdom, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.96,0:11:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We still need to use your bath though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.80,0:11:59.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.71,0:12:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ace, this one is way too\Nbig, I need your help! You?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.50,0:12:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The mighty King Luffy needs help?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.68,0:12:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.10,0:12:20.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.76,0:12:36.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's the Dawn Kingdom! We need help!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.52,0:12:37.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy got hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.80,0:12:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.10,0:12:41.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Magra!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.01,0:12:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up! This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.38,0:12:45.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.40,0:12:46.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, bring him inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.38,0:13:00.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.66,0:13:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a good thing you brought\Nhim here when you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.02,0:13:07.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, if this cut had been any deeper,\Nhe probably would have died on the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.24,0:13:12.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to say it, but this is\Nno good with only two of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.82,0:13:16.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.24,0:13:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew better.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.08,0:13:23.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if you're a captain, fighting\Nalone doesn't make you any stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.34,0:13:26.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.22,0:13:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still not good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.86,0:13:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.58,0:13:36.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.64,0:13:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I let you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.66,0:13:50.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys, come see!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.82,0:13:53.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Makino came to visit,\Nand she brought booze!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.10,0:13:57.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to know how to\Nproperly say thank you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.66,0:13:59.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.82,0:14:02.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what's this about paying respects?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.24,0:14:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a pirate and as Luffy's big brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.24,0:14:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to pay my respects\Nto this Shanks guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.52,0:14:11.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy says he owes the man his life,\Nso it's kind of the least I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.32,0:14:22.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got something to say to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.12,0:14:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.72,0:14:28.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I think I can give you some tips.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.10,0:14:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For starters, after a meal...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.48,0:14:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a dining dish!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.90,0:14:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.90,0:14:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec, we almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.06,0:14:40.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta pay respect. Oops!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.16,0:14:42.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.76,0:14:44.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.50,0:14:47.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the meal, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.06,0:14:49.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Keep your thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.50,0:14:51.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you brats gonna pay me or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.56,0:14:56.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not losing today! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.06,0:15:34.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, now it's time to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.22,0:15:35.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now for some bear stew!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:35.26,0:16:39.93,Captions,,0,0,25,,{\fad(1000,725)}Seven years later
Dialogue: 1,0:16:41.26,0:16:45.70,Captions,,0,0,20,,{\fad(1000,725)}Ace, seventeen years old
Dialogue: 1,0:16:47.00,0:16:51.84,Captions,,0,0,20,,{\fad(1000,1500)}Luffy, fourteen years old
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.22,0:17:05.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take care, Ace. See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.80,0:17:07.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.71,0:17:08.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.63,0:17:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep training hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.54,0:17:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just give me three years\Nand before you know it,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.24,0:17:15.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my wanted poster's gonna\Nbe everywhere you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.92,0:17:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kick some ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.58,0:17:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bon voyage!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.54,0:17:28.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't catch a cold out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.78,0:17:30.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look for me in the papers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.20,0:17:31.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't take long, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.22,0:17:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world did not know that the son\Nof Gol Roger had grown up in secret,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.54,0:17:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nor did they know that he set sail that\Nday, determined to make a name of his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.34,0:18:00.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.14,0:18:05.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, if Garp were here,\Nthink of what he'd say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.60,0:18:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gonna need you to raise\Nthis baby for me. What? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.46,0:18:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it even yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.90,0:18:31.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So there you are, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.64,0:18:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, believe it or not, Ace is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.84,0:18:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.36,0:18:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One last brat to worry about, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.34,0:18:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Garp will give me hell for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.26,0:18:43.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kid left, and he's still\Ncausing me trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.58,0:18:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.68,0:18:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a message he\Nasked us to give to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.92,0:18:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, why should I care?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.62,0:18:52.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He probably just wants to tell\Nme my feet smell or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.56,0:18:55.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said, thank you for taking care of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.82,0:19:03.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you do that to me, you beast?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.62,0:19:06.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.76,0:19:08.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not crying, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.16,0:19:10.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't shut up, I'll make you cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.28,0:19:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three more years, that's the rule!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.92,0:19:28.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now gum-gum-pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.16,0:19:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So close!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.76,0:19:35.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just need a little more!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.42,0:19:39.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You almost got it now, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.92,0:19:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bend your legs a little\Nand aim straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.26,0:19:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now gum-gum-pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.86,0:20:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep getting stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.50,0:20:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on, Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.10,0:20:08.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming for you!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:09.27,0:20:11.52,Captions,,0,0,170,,{\fs60\fad(430,0)}Several months later...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.78,0:20:17.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.28,0:20:20.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you gotta see the paper, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.80,0:20:21.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.80,0:20:23.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just like he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.00,0:20:26.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, you're right, Ace made the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.70,0:20:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got a ship and a crew and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.10,0:20:31.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh man, I'm so jealous, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.12,0:20:36.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm gonna do even better.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:40.74,0:20:44.72,Captions,,0,0,350,,{\fs60\fad(1030,0)}Three years later...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:40.74,0:20:44.72,Captions,,0,0,50,,{\fs60\fad(1030,0)}Luffy, seventeen years old
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.42,0:20:46.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.70,0:20:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving now, you're\Nnot gonna see me off? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.16,0:20:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use your head for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.92,0:20:55.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The mayor and Makino\Nwouldn't mind us stopping by,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.68,0:20:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but as for everyone else\Nin Windmill Village,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.90,0:21:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'd probably scare the\Npants right off them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.30,0:21:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.56,0:21:04.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh, don't make it\Nawkward, just go already!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.52,0:21:05.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.52,0:21:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, goodbye, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.24,0:21:08.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.66,0:21:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure gonna miss you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.02,0:21:11.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, now don't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.30,0:21:12.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna make us blush!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.84,0:21:14.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, bye! Take it easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.08,0:21:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.16,0:21:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys too, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.12,0:21:20.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, one last thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.94,0:21:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad, I still think mountain\Nbandits are super lame!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.36,0:21:25.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up and leave, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.96,0:21:29.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you guys, you're great!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.02,0:21:35.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not enough to ruin my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.20,0:21:37.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you got to break my heart, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.48,0:21:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're awful, I tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.12,0:21:41.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of you are good for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.08,0:21:43.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry I made you cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.86,0:21:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up or I'll make you cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.24,0:21:52.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now to Windmill Village on Dawn\NIsland at the edge of the Goa Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.84,0:21:56.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No offense, but why don't you take\Nmy old fishing boat instead, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.94,0:21:59.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That thing is going to sink\Nas soon as you get out to sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.74,0:22:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's too small, even for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.14,0:22:05.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to start small, but\NI'll get a real big one soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.54,0:22:06.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.58,0:22:11.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sabo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.76,0:22:13.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.94,0:22:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out for me out there, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.42,0:22:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sabo was first, and Ace was second.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.16,0:22:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I may be the last to go, but\NI'm going to be the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.26,0:22:28.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming for you, Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.86,0:22:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And all my special moves work now, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.68,0:22:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you talking to yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.22,0:22:35.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this some kind of\Npirate ritual I don't get?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.30,0:22:41.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's a challenge to my brother,\NAce. Ace? Who is that? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.16,0:22:44.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm going for real now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.18,0:22:56.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew this day would come,\Nbut I'm still a bit sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.62,0:22:57.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll sure miss him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.88,0:23:01.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Satisfied, like the world\Nneeds another pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.50,0:23:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, perfect weather today. Lock me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.34,0:23:14.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.26,0:23:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.96,0:23:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.24,0:23:29.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a while, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.44,0:23:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This won't play out like last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.18,0:23:40.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been practicing this\Nmove for ten whole years!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.48,0:23:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Gon-Gon!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.90,0:23:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.68,0:24:11.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Been waiting a long time to do that. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.82,0:24:13.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.26,0:24:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just took out that\Nsea monster in one punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.70,0:24:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta admit, I'm proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.94,0:24:29.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, I need a crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.44,0:24:32.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About ten people should be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.32,0:24:35.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After that, pirate flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.48,0:24:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.92,0:24:39.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.84,0:24:43.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someday I'm gonna be...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.30,0:24:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.60,0:25:00.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But time has not been kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.00,0:25:07.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And after the death of Ace, Luffy's\Noptimism from that day is nowhere in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.10,0:25:22.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blaze, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.60,0:25:25.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.02,0:25:27.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.42,0:25:30.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.10,0:25:31.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Garp!
Dialogue: 1,0:25:31.29,0:25:35.88,Captions,,0,0,30,,{\fad(500,0)}East Blue - Goa Kingdom - Windmill Village
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.06,0:25:35.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Garp is back and he brought\Nhis battleship! Should we run?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.06,0:25:38.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I read about the battle at\NMarineford in the paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.90,0:25:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Congratulations on your victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.16,0:25:43.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Word travels fast these days, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.42,0:25:44.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is Luffy okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.68,0:25:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that Whitebeard's dead, the\Npirates are going out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.12,0:25:49.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that why you're here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.46,0:25:50.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things have gotten bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.92,0:25:52.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're afraid to go out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.22,0:25:54.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're like vultures staring us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.04,0:25:58.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't mean to complain, but I'm\Nafraid they can invade any second now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.02,0:25:59.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.93,0:26:03.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just sunk three of them with\Ncannonballs on the way out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.06,0:26:05.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really? Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.14,0:26:08.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were nothing but\Na bunch of blowhards.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.80,0:26:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All bark and no bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.56,0:26:12.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The seas are going to\Nbe tense the world over
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.76,0:26:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,without Whitebeard to\Nscare off all the thugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.44,0:26:18.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if that's not the\NNavy's official stance.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.48,0:26:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, since you're so far from our base,\NI prepared a little something. See? Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.08,0:26:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Security by Navy Vice Admiral Garp?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.26,0:26:30.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'll scare them off for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.52,0:26:33.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One look at that and\Nthey'll straighten right up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.70,0:26:36.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While you're here,\Nthere's one more problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.44,0:26:38.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A bunch of mountain bandits\Ncame down to the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.02,0:26:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They took over Maki-no's\Nbar and they aren't leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.96,0:26:42.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.48,0:26:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.86,0:26:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, Garp.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.18,0:26:52.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's one right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.20,0:26:56.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you show your face here?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.62,0:26:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After what you've done!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.34,0:27:02.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Garp! That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.36,0:27:03.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Var General
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.84,0:27:11.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back off, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.58,0:27:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.96,0:27:17.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hell I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.34,0:27:20.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were right with them\Non that battlefield?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.04,0:27:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those poor boys and you didn't\Ndo a damn thing to help them!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.96,0:27:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you have me raise ace, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.24,0:27:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you have me take care of\Nthem if it was good in this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.82,0:27:43.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You stood there and watched that boy die!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.58,0:27:48.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You care more about your\Ndamn job than your family!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.08,0:27:50.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The great hero of the Navy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.46,0:27:53.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you're proud of yourself,\Nyou heartless piece of crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.72,0:27:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, now, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.24,0:27:56.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.98,0:27:58.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say something, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.08,0:28:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you help him?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.50,0:28:02.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you do something?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.26,0:28:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look me right in the face,\Nyou spineless wretch!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.90,0:28:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You answer me, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.38,0:28:10.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dejan, enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.30,0:28:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knock it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.72,0:28:38.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you think he feels?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.34,0:28:39.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's their grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.64,0:28:40.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's suffering too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.10,0:28:43.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was right there and\Nhe couldn't do a thing
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.20,0:28:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.50,0:28:58.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Garp is suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.44,0:29:01.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.12,0:29:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only one who's really\Nsuffering here is Luffy damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.04,0:29:20.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, so let's pretend Shanks\Nis here with you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.54,0:29:21.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.14,0:29:23.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, I'm Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.78,0:29:25.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you? Boo!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.96,0:29:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you're pirates, but I\Ndon't think he'd be impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.46,0:29:30.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.37,0:29:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be way more cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.18,0:29:35.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fancy meeting you here. Boo!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.22,0:29:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mister, what's your deal? Boo.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.92,0:29:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because he didn't say punk?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.98,0:29:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope, nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.22,0:29:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.88,0:29:47.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're distracting poor Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.68,0:29:49.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go be stupid somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.30,0:29:50.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're learning here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.26,0:29:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You little pest.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.60,0:29:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not distracting.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.06,0:29:53.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.22,0:29:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found an anaconda nest filled with a\Nbunch of eggs and they're super huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.32,0:29:59.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's grab them and cook them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.00,0:30:00.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.91,0:30:02.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, that sounds awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.38,0:30:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.64,0:30:07.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna learn some\Nmanners even if it kills me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.34,0:30:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't go on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.92,0:30:10.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if the anaconda mom finds me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.22,0:30:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you're there with\Nme, we can beat it for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.94,0:30:14.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.85,0:30:15.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said no.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.02,0:30:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy loved Ace more than\Nanything in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.00,0:30:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Makino!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.04,0:30:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Garp.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.62,0:30:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.30,0:30:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The newspaper said he went\Nmissing after the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.32,0:30:43.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.76,0:30:51.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The submarine carried him away.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.24,0:30:56.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The admirals attacked and tried\Nto stop him from escaping,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.84,0:30:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and afterwards they held a search.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.92,0:31:01.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they couldn't find\Na single trace of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.36,0:31:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was no shipwreck,\Nso he's probably alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.38,0:31:08.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.72,0:31:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, so what's up with this bandit?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.78,0:31:14.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She obviously seems to know Garp, but\Nwhy did he let her punch him like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.00,0:31:15.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.64,0:31:24.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy's been a little moron\Nsince the day I met him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.62,0:31:28.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But no matter what he does,\NI'm always on his side.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.86,0:31:34.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As much as I'm hurting,\NI know he's got it worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.38,0:31:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it breaks my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.52,0:31:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know things are hard right\Nnow, but don't you dare give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.82,0:32:04.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, far away and far along the Grand\NLine, in a place known as the New World,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.82,0:32:35.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how I can\Never thank you enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.34,0:32:39.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No need to make a big deal out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.92,0:32:44.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard was a rival, but I still\Nheld a lot of respect for the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.98,0:32:46.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even Sengoku felt that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.42,0:32:51.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose it's time for us to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.68,0:32:53.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thank you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.36,0:32:58.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can only imagine how\Ntough this is on Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.70,0:33:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even so, his brother died like a true man.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.82,0:33:07.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it back, or else.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.34,0:33:10.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know anything about\Nthe man who saved my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.24,0:33:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is his era!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.86,0:33:14.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you forget it!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.80,0:33:22.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe Ace wouldn't want to hear this,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.20,0:33:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but that's exactly what\NCaptain Roger would have done.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.06,0:33:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There were times when I wished\Nhe wasn't too bold to run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.34,0:33:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bold to shed tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.44,0:33:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, Luffy, it's not only victory\Nthat makes a man, but defeat,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.74,0:33:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,joy and sorrow alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.34,0:33:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no shame in backing down.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.94,0:34:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no shame in crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.36,0:34:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So long as you overcome it.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:16.38,0:34:20.42,Captions,,0,0,30,,{\fad(1000,500)}"Calm Belt" - Island of Women
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.24,0:34:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.44,0:34:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't save my crew or my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.36,0:34:31.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.34,0:34:33.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.58,0:34:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.34,0:34:38.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.38,0:34:43.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although I understand your pain, I will\Nnot allow you to hurt yourself any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.14,0:34:45.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not your business!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.80,0:34:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my body!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.56,0:34:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What of Ace, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.82,0:34:51.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who sacrificed his body to protect you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.84,0:34:53.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was that none of your business?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.96,0:34:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard! Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.96,0:34:58.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say one more word and I'm gonna crush you!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.86,0:35:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that would make you happy,\Nthen why don't you try?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.96,0:35:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But let me warn you, injured though.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.28,0:35:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am you will not defeat\Nme not in that condition
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.16,0:35:37.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.90,0:35:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A while back, when I\Nwas hunting down Teach,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.28,0:35:48.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I went to Alabasta Kingdom, and I saw my\Nbrother for the first time in three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.56,0:35:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As soon as I saw his face, a\Nweight lifted from my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.10,0:35:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And do you know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.54,0:36:03.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.45,0:36:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.60,0:36:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.50,0:36:09.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of your nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.72,0:36:18.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, you can't see a thing. You're blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.38,0:36:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You never doubted your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.42,0:36:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.50,0:36:26.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the confidence that once allowed you to\Nsoar above the clouds has been shattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.74,0:36:30.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your brother who was your\Nguiding light has faded away.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.10,0:36:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and your enemy stands so\Ntall and casts so great a
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.02,0:36:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,shadow that you can do naught\Nbut cower in the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.38,0:36:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, you strike out like an animal at\Nthe cage your doubt has placed around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.78,0:36:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So long as you are consumed\Nby regret and guilt,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.00,0:36:50.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you will never find your way forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.40,0:36:56.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, your pain may be great,\Nbut it mustn't devour you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.74,0:36:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is yet joy beyond your sorrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.10,0:37:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's gone may be gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.86,0:37:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you still have something left in\Nthis world to treasure, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.24,0:37:57.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, if you want to screw\Naround, go do it somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.46,0:37:59.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to build muscle here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.40,0:38:05.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.34,0:38:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got a big storm on the horizon!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.68,0:38:09.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make preparations, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.80,0:38:12.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had a big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.28,0:38:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just missed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.44,0:38:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the next one is\Ngoing to be even bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.66,0:38:20.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scram.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.57,0:38:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm almost done.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.74,0:38:23.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just keep your pants on.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.14,0:38:24.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.24,0:38:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how bad you're\Nhurt, you're in good hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.88,0:38:30.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, this one\Nmight sting a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.06,0:38:36.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.78,0:38:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you like treasure, this\Nresearch is fascinating. Come see.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.88,0:38:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.14,0:38:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're checking on the coal\Nengine, it's in super shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.38,0:38:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if you're checking on\Nme, well, I'm super too.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.80,0:38:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Captain Rise and Shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.34,0:38:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about I play you a little song?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.32,0:38:59.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to really get those bones moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.04,0:39:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.86,0:39:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.08,0:39:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.52,0:39:36.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.62,0:39:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still have my crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.48,0:39:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro, Nami, Usopp, Sanji, Jumper,\NRobin, Franky, and Brooke.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.30,0:39:49.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're still out there waiting for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.94,0:39:53.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.42,0:39:58.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to get back to this ship,\Nno matter how long it takes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.76,0:40:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys, meet back on the\Nsunny in three days! Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.10,0:40:07.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything's a mess, and I'm already late.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.04,0:40:10.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I have to make it back to Sabo.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.98,0:40:12.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know they'll be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.44,0:40:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't just knowing he was\Nsafe, or seeing him smile again.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.74,0:40:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you've got a bungling kid brother\Nlike me, you can't help but worry a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.44,0:40:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He might be a bit much for all of you to\Nhandle, but take good care of him for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.38,0:40:38.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, sure, he wasn't the snot-nosed\Nkid following me around anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.90,0:40:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but more than that, he had friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.38,0:40:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A crew that he could depend on.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.80,0:40:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what, he'll be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.68,0:40:56.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I don't have to worry anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.94,0:41:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish they were here right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.70,0:41:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I miss them!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.28,0:41:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I miss my crew!

